# Cursor Rules
- Always read `docs/MASTER_CONTEXT.md` (or `MASTER_CONTEXT.md`) for active project state, path definitions, and execution history.
- Log session progress in `docs/PROGRESS.md`; keep architecture in MASTER_CONTEXT.
- GitHub remote: https://github.com/ixamal/music_migration (scripts + docs only — never commit audio / NML / master.db / giant JSON catalogs).
- Never write destructive file-moving code without offering a `--dry-run` option first.
- Use `pathlib.Path` for cross-platform, clean path manipulations in Python.
- Git authorship: commits and PRs must be David alone — never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor attribution trailer.

